  "description": {
    "text": "The reward pack (奖赏包) is the one-card prize in the Happy Set Decidueye & Melmetal & Koraidon & Miraidon of 10 April 2026, shared out by the results of the games. It holds one of 14 holos: one of the eight basic Energy, in 87.5% of packs, or one of six Pokémon ex, in 12.5%: Decidueye ex, Pikachu ex, Miraidon ex, Tinkaton ex, Koraidon ex and Snorlax ex. The six Pokémon ex are numbered out of 6.",
